    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump. Fail. Rage. Repeat.</strong><br>Welcome to the <i>worst parkour game you\u2019ll ever get addicted to</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brutally difficult platformer throws you into a rage-inducing vertical climb with no checkpoints, no mercy, and absolutely zero hand-holding. Miss one jump? Back to the very start</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Checkpoints:</strong> Fall once, and it\u2019s all the way down. Every. Single. Time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression:</strong> 100% precision platforming. No RNG, no excuses just you and your ability (or lack thereof).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Design, Maximum Pain:</strong> Simple controls, clean visuals, and a level layout designed purely to break your spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Giant Climb:</strong> No saves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-Friendly:</strong> If you're a need for speed, this game tracks your time from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> You\u2019ll keep coming back\u2026 not because you want to, but because you <i>have</i> to prove you can beat it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is not fun. It\u2019s not fair. And yet\u2026 you won\u2019t be able to stop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you somehow reach the top, congratulations you either have god-tier reflexes or way too much free time. Probably both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try it. Regret it. Try again.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump. Fail. Rage. Repeat.</strong><br>Welcome to the <i>worst parkour game you\u2019ll ever get addicted to</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brutally difficult platformer throws you into a rage-inducing vertical climb with no checkpoints, no mercy, and absolutely zero hand-holding. Miss one jump? Back to the very start</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Checkpoints:</strong> Fall once, and it\u2019s all the way down. Every. Single. Time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression:</strong> 100% precision platforming. No RNG, no excuses just you and your ability (or lack thereof).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Design, Maximum Pain:</strong> Simple controls, clean visuals, and a level layout designed purely to break your spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Giant Climb:</strong> No saves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-Friendly:</strong> If you're a need for speed, this game tracks your time from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> You\u2019ll keep coming back\u2026 not because you want to, but because you <i>have</i> to prove you can beat it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is not fun. It\u2019s not fair. And yet\u2026 you won\u2019t be able to stop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you somehow reach the top, congratulations you either have god-tier reflexes or way too much free time. Probably both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try it. Regret it. Try again.</strong></p>",
